    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6b127db3b9d0c50075f78c20",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "…请下达许可。\n请下达庆祝主人的生日，\n祝愿你能得到幸福…的许可。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b57881d4ba0d34dd7bd18ea994d10745d7196f467510b338b000158222346477",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1026",
        "10012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c19d81eca5969697d8cc93e0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天是我的生日…偶尔会被问到\n『制造日期是什么时候？』，\n其实和我的生日是同一天。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a259e82f836e12ac5ca6ebfe1e3b2502a7653dcc1dae23b9a1c01b8365347bdd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1026",
        "10013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1e82a59b658472513baf21d8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "主人，今天是我的生日。\n…愿望是能获得新的训练器具。\n…那个，可以…吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "1a13d2bc00e1d14a5d44772a8911734f900febdbf0986c6677750a0c8922724f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1026",
        "10014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bee5cd96cc211e170538e8bb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "主人，\n有通知送到了。\n请确认。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c6f82860ca2b6d876283e07ddf93d40d65da9fa8437b5eba7c93af9b00c87251",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1026",
        "10015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e3f19429b2669c663cc492bc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好像有礼物。\n没有发现危险物品，\n请放心。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c5146b04254979ce56569be4e41ce82d777ce221b507b61b06a0b97f737aec5c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1026",
        "10016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:950fef6bd6f720d69d3ea279",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "恭喜，主人。\n任务，已确认\n完成。",
      "source_fingerprint": "dc509ccfb5178f3b1aa8db259c6341b2e5944f88d10b70d95534728b50b22d29",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1026",
        "10017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b3562ff6abaae63523a7d022",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "主人，有报告。\n是关于将要举行的活动。\n…要开始运转准备吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "2bb64f9fe6016763512d6373fb30bb52540ed54c2ef8f49277cce1d35f3fd63b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1026",
        "10018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:797bae1bcd4e82678cc7a96b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "活动开始了。\n美浦波旁，可以启动。\n如有必要的话随时可以下达指令。",
      "source_fingerprint": "85adab37bbc15f311b3371abef802b9db50db71f7b2ed20c986fa2594f4a52e6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1026",
        "10019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d7ff830e3ac9c48a3de86c87",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "…需要验证。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e737b5b67ffea84d5903f1d099e6e80a17b13f7ca38ffaba9629725ae2ef5cb4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1026",
        "1002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:be260eff41397d25bcafee96",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "已确认到赛马娘名鉴\n等级提升。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d5b9868183c5bef1a6181e7ffb6b3b56a929be2634cd8f5128aac18cb3145a26",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1026",
        "10021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4789d4623e05224e277eb985",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "帽T上的字是「CHAMP」。\r\n父亲有一顶标志相同的帽子。\r\n跟我「成对」。",
      "source_fingerprint": "93c3e17a986676fa7fb863935f4c9892a26c5999fb3a6814e0d17ae52044352c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1026",
        "10025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2a1b99ed4e01c1b4c22b1bcf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这套衣服重视机动性，因此也能\r\n对应突发状况。从前，我曾经\r\n追过汽车，把遗失物交给对方。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7b12868fcd04f9aa661e0108359dc344b33d26c361343f4616ac3b0aa8713751",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1026",
        "10026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4a96dec6eb96fc99f87ccd10",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "私下外出时我会记得\r\n目的地的地图。\r\n即使手机故障也不影响。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ff3e20394514374282d91119b0ff10385be350c6c76c67e3eb92d50d9f071744",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1026",
        "10027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7a262b3efecef356685f4d5b",
