        "1026",
        "140018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c3aa88c25da361af667c9c7d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "明天将得到这些。",
      "source_fingerprint": "13e45f9dda0a7b20fd749a986fe02d315372a876786408a109e3a682b735f616",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1026",
        "15"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:237adcad4214ec7f798e62c5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "确认到体力低下。\n问题轻微…还可以运作。",
      "source_fingerprint": "591df6f974e67b8a8b5c64f164e29adfd37973aa4126b6d0280483cf77d92f8c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1026",
        "20000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3fa03ff7920b9b57a477fcfa",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "…感知到疲劳\n输出可能会降低。",
      "source_fingerprint": "452735444e3f72ec1b3ddb933cb22686efb4e68000e19afb980787f2552b3e04",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1026",
        "20001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:14315e3460ab3f32a70cf89d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "全功能正常。\n判断，任何困难\n都可以克服。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bf3c980b31344e34aa155737827d24a1e0f6c3e934d9210b8b7a4d90d5c3b127",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1026",
        "20002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a0db3bcf064f691b5a4b91ba",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "感知到状态『高涨』。\n…下达命令后，\n将取得高于一般状态的结果。",
      "source_fingerprint": "920d4ead29c5d6fb9e4a1837124b5cc1b5cb91eae391a89f381248920a34efce",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1026",
        "20003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ff45d7c0e4aa064995fb3120",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "奔跑功能，良好。\n随时可以起跑。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1733f05929fd27447c101a233a5b07bcf00c7313926a54e88dfb4d4fa23b518f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1026",
        "20004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:34ddac59170549b5d6d7ad9d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "能量储存完毕，\n已准备万全。\n随时可以发出信号。",
      "source_fingerprint": "15696d73a11ea7c14e353eed1b5ab65ad9db428ed02f7f2bfbb29f933d1e7ea4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1026",
        "20005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7c23b2c0c75dc44fcecd8c89",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "没有检测出问题。\n判断可以达到相应的结果。",
      "source_fingerprint": "81057736d64bb3ce742af84e9a51be8151d1ebf4c7cd728b50a36f140dd034b9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1026",
        "20006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:186e68392e821c6af3e9bc82",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "动作确认完毕。\n一旦接收到新指令，\n将立即执行。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ffb6598d95169dd3fbebb77cc0deb05502909494cbb4e2cb47bdbc60976e9ae0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1026",
        "20007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0c1b2b09ef94a8f0d2d3fb87",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "输出存在问题…但是…\n判断仍可继续运作。",
      "source_fingerprint": "751102d2df66ebd341382032622e8f1f27592f0429f138e1cec56956ab0682bc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1026",
        "20008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0a554893c57eb8dd3075c994",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "…确认到精力低下。\n预测此状态下\n很难拿出成果。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b5177da0308a69862d6532fe7713784276fba9e18ef089d5dca352b9e9dd42ba",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1026",
        "20009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1166c930d5a65053a00db3d9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "全功能，输出低下中…\n推测状态为\n『絶不調』…",
      "source_fingerprint": "7673015ad84f11e7c8f178a5cc090b308f083693ac07e36fd57d7f997322c0da",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1026",
        "20010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5f019766f34151e461b74157",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不良状态…\n目前状态下，所有\n结果均无法预测…",
      "source_fingerprint": "1242b980c0526f001c6dad63eb1a6bd80e171a2ec06828dbec172cee958cede9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1026",
        "20011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f3e21b7c56b519e42ee18d39",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "连续参加比赛中。\n预测到机能低下，\n但我会尽力做到最好。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a0c357e5c16f71815139b1e2da1f357655fdf3c513eb25f0e050ba38739faaae",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1026",
        "20021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:caf7f0d68d6ca481926c7dcb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "由于连续参赛，奔跑时负担\n增大。极大可能发生问题。\n…尽管如此，我也要…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "39ee1bb1fe3e486ce40e07668963b55ed6b4db8273766280bbad2c1476a4e27b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1026",
        "20022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5a115fbf08b146686f1b1be2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "根据训练\n计算调整结果…\n状态显示『良好』。",
      "source_fingerprint": "98f947de43dd1e9e4cfe1042f7f79f95f846e9a4f275db29b5c3e62622c2c2b9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1026",
        "20023"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3a6032db60cfee0814e7957f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "判断状态完美。\n能得到最好的结果吗。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5251770a07db988ab71dd1fe558b9ee9c35f28be129a5a954f276fd6f6674841",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1026",
        "20024"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:01d9b9b59d05e667f69407a8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "调整完备。判断获胜概率\n与状态呈正比。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d10b835f9713af3fdfb17c7398bd78c5eaaecdf21b77ac5e0e30a3eee0c83f0e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1026",
        "20025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:feb20a05d23d8a79aa85da1e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "根据适当的训练分配，\n确认准备充分。\n…能办到。",
      "source_fingerprint": "644217152dfbd90213061966fe3bd07158420a27ceb8c5de2ae9e61520863575",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1026",
        "20026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9b9a5fc1728d68a9ede59a51",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "确认目前的状态。\n判断调整符合预期。\n瞄准第1名。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f58376fbb1979d950aa5ec04275ab7b8704073cf04d9e9354b44ce820c521a68",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1026",
        "20027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dbe468af1f1e106cefa4e37b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "目标比赛，分析完毕。\n可应对各种状况。\n请下指示，主人。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c400f6db38cc3e25c4a3b1d312ecbf3f0c007bdeb1393c66ad462b35f1cdaae6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1026",
        "20028"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bccf1afd962c0933873d7f92",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "认知为重要比赛。\n调整结果『相符』\n…无须担心。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f8598562df178ac50c98060f978c578399f8f96585460600ab209831981c28a0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1026",
        "20029"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8a98ffc34f461585df1010b0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "维持在正常表现。\n走吧，主人。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ae9092b96f3d724d608ccdffd6e952e898c5b3196e074abf6223b7db6ae83040",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1026",
        "20030"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7709a4b72e3ee0cedb374314",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "载入迄今为止的\n训练数据。\n启动，已稳定。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fa9083da48b54dee0569e2c1b0704154c3c0de84d72a30447d4ad3dc59570aca",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1026",
        "20031"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cf0ce9772561aee9ae6595ed",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "对奔跑精度持有不安。\n…但是，这种程度的问题\n我会用『努力』来覆盖。",
      "source_fingerprint": "36cdb7bf812cdc68a0a4a8fa42a84a176047161f18f06794d1c3a1414aa85126",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1026",
        "20032"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1d007ec15619bccb75af80e7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "…感知到强者的气息。\n主人，请赋予我\n『鼓劲』。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c30944879f92b6736da9deefcc9dc2234513389e3faaf6cc760ec46f7fb70de0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1026",
        "20033"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1ff290d2d8f1aa959778f463",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "…感知到身体僵硬。\n启动精神统一模式。\n尝试稳定功能控制。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8b4ed20c0ae44fd7d0f8f78f2227f7fe111bb51e0ce126c34333bcfe0ce152e6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1026",
        "20034"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:184a500e82256c9453a13889",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "确认到调整状态『不安』。\n…我会在现状下\n尽最大努力。",
      "source_fingerprint": "25e57f679fe8803e4711562797dc9d4e1b948b00cd1ee03d6ec30bf718de9ebd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1026",
        "20035"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9c8244ceb6d18a91d9927e15",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "状态・胆怯已排除。\n不论什么情况，\n我都一定会胜利。",
      "source_fingerprint": "68b655d858056596e0643f567dd21c213953b975d6089062168f066910d1a868",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1026",
        "20036"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f94a96a747c5c92f52a50366",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "无论可能性有多低，\n都用努力全部覆盖…\n这就是美浦波旁的跑法。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3b1d0a68c32d66c7e716b36674282d6dd5b46de06f61eef00299d0e98f1bb97d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1026",
        "20037"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f6865ea5e142d297fb7bfdfa",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "开始。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1b3aec20fad242e07275c683d2426e01e00ff02188e60e8e3680d12d8ddf21aa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1026",
        "20038"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:abff45ab62c3843a981c1039",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "执行。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1a6503b4ac9164f036768c6aec1311808a2819dc06fd28e9bf788ecef581cb18",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1026",
        "20039"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
